  "description": "Research a Salesforce topic for a learner using a citation-first, release-aware evidence workflow: bound the question, prioritize official sources, build a claim ledger, resolve contradictions, and produce a research packet for teaching. Trigger keywords: research Salesforce topic, find official Salesforce docs, prepare learning sources, verify Salesforce concept, release-aware research. Repository package authoring and upstream intake remain outside this package. NOT for the final learner-facing explanation \u2014 use admin/salesforce-learning-brief.",
